  <prompt>Build `RecordFamilyModal` in `src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/RecordFamilyModal/`, composing `SprkModal/presets/BrowseModal`, that calls `GET /api/v1/records/{table}/{id}/family` and shows the family with selection, a truncation notice, "load more", and an action toolbar whose two actions (Push field updates, Update Assigned To) call a caller-supplied handler.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE front-end developer, React 16/17-compatible Fluent UI v9, shared component library.</role>
  <goal>A reusable modal that lists a record's family per FR-32 and hands confirmed rows to an action handler; it never acts on rows the person did not confirm.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>spec.md FR-32; design.md §12.3 E. Actions call /push with preview → confirm → apply (FR-34, task 040). Until 040 ships, the actions render disabled with a tooltip "Available after the push update" — the modal is a read-only Family view. Columns (owner): name, record number (blank when none), record type, status, modified on. Group by level and table.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="new">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/RecordFamilyModal/RecordFamilyModal.tsx</file>
      <file role="new">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/RecordFamilyModal/recordFamilyService.ts (fetch + types for the FR-31 contract)</file>
      <file role="new">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/RecordFamilyModal/index.ts</file>
      <file role="new">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/RecordFamilyModal/__tests__/RecordFamilyModal.test.tsx</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/index.ts (export)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/SprkModal/presets/BrowseModal.tsx</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/AccessGrantModal/AccessGrantModal.tsx (authenticated BFF fetch, loading/error states, test doubles via __tests__/helpers/authenticatedFetchDouble.ts)</file>
    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-050 / MODAL-DECISION-CRITERIA">Compose BrowseModal (Layout 2); no new modal shell.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-021">Fluent v9 semantic tokens only; dark-mode safe; icons currentColor. Visual anchor: mirror AccessGrantModal's spacing, header and empty/error states.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-022">Compatible with the React version the TrackingFieldTrio PCF bundles (the library already ships AccessGrantModal to it).</constraint>
    <constraint source="FR-32">Actions receive only confirmed rows (table, id); the server re-checks everything. No action runs on open.</constraint>
    <constraint source="FR-31">Show nothing that the API did not return (no counts of hidden records). Field values null → blank cell.</constraint>
    <constraint source="CLAUDE.md §17">Before writing, read docs/standards/MODAL-DECISION-CRITERIA.md and MODAL-DESIGN-SYSTEM.md.</constraint>
  </constraints>

